OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA sunny start to the weekend
OL,6,Fbefore cloud bubbles up by the
OL,7,Fafternoon. Some sunny spells still
OL,8,Flikely, becoming more prolonged again
OL,9,Fby evening. Feeling cool with a light,
OL,10,Fgenerally northerly breeze.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FAny lingering cloud
OL,13,Fdissipating through the evening to
OL,14,Fleave long clear spells across the
OL,15,Fregion overnight. Frosty patches
OL,16,Fpossible in prone locations by the
OL,17,Fmorning.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
