OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FAnother sunny start on Sunday
OL,6,Fwith patchy cloud once again bubbling
OL,7,Fup. Isolated showers possible through
OL,8,Fthe afternoon. Remaining chilly, with
OL,9,Flight winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,12,FCloudier to start the week with some
OL,13,Fmostly light rain developing at times
OL,14,Fon Monday and Tuesday. Some brighter
OL,15,Fspells also possible. Further rain
OL,16,Fexpected midweek, and perhaps turning
OL,17,Fwindy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
